{"audio": "public/audio/gp30-duracion.mp3", "duracion": 81.789388, "escenas": [{"ini": 0.06, "fin": 4.26, "texto": "«¿Cuánto tarda coser el toldo?» Ramón responde: «Un rato».", "palabras": [{"w": "«¿Cuánto", "ini": 0.06, "fin": 0.36}, {"w": "tarda", "ini": 0.5, "fin": 0.76}, {"w": "coser", "ini": 0.84, "fin": 1.1}, {"w": "el", "ini": 1.14, "fin": 1.22}, {"w": "toldo?»", "ini": 1.3, "fin": 1.6}, {"w": "Ramón", "ini": 2.38, "fin": 2.66}, {"w": "responde:", "ini": 2.72, "fin": 3.22}, {"w": "«Un", "ini": 3.8, "fin": 3.92}, {"w": "rato».", "ini": 4, "fin": 4.26}]}, {"ini": 5.06, "fin": 6.8, "texto": "Con eso no se puede planear.", "palabras": [{"w": "Con", "ini": 5.06, "fin": 5.2}, {"w": "eso", "ini": 5.28, "fin": 5.52}, {"w": "no", "ini": 5.78, "fin": 5.86}, {"w": "se", "ini": 5.94, "fin": 6.02}, {"w": "puede", "ini": 6.1, "fin": 6.32}, {"w": "planear.", "ini": 6.38, "fin": 6.8}]}, {"ini": 7.5, "fin": 15.1, "texto": "Estimar la duración de las actividades es calcular cuántos períodos de trabajo necesita cada una, con los recursos estimados.", "palabras": [{"w": "Estimar", "ini": 7.5, "fin": 7.92}, {"w": "la", "ini": 7.96, "fin": 8.02}, {"w": "duración", "ini": 8.06, "fin": 8.46}, {"w": "de", "ini": 8.5, "fin": 8.54}, {"w": "las", "ini": 8.58, "fin": 8.68}, {"w": "actividades", "ini": 8.74, "fin": 9.4}, {"w": "es", "ini": 9.72, "fin": 9.86}, {"w": "calcular", "ini": 9.9, "fin": 10.36}, {"w": "cuántos", "ini": 10.5, "fin": 10.9}, {"w": "períodos", "ini": 10.98, "fin": 11.46}, {"w": "de", "ini": 11.5, "fin": 11.56}, {"w": "trabajo", "ini": 11.62, "fin": 12.02}, {"w": "necesita", "ini": 12.06, "fin": 12.58}, {"w": "cada", "ini": 12.74, "fin": 12.98}, {"w": "una,", "ini": 13.08, "fin": 13.24}, {"w": "con", "ini": 13.62, "fin": 13.74}, {"w": "los", "ini": 13.76, "fin": 13.9}, {"w": "recursos", "ini": 13.96, "fin": 14.44}, {"w": "estimados.", "ini": 14.5, "fin": 15.1}]}, {"ini": 16.08, "fin": 23.42, "texto": "Pía puede mirar un proyecto parecido: el toldo de otra sede tomó tres días. Es la estimación análoga.", "palabras": [{"w": "Pía", "ini": 16.08, "fin": 16.34}, {"w": "puede", "ini": 16.66, "fin": 16.86}, {"w": "mirar", "ini": 16.9, "fin": 17.1}, {"w": "un", "ini": 17.14, "fin": 17.2}, {"w": "proyecto", "ini": 17.24, "fin": 17.62}, {"w": "parecido:", "ini": 17.7, "fin": 18.18}, {"w": "el", "ini": 18.62, "fin": 18.7}, {"w": "toldo", "ini": 18.84, "fin": 19.12}, {"w": "de", "ini": 19.16, "fin": 19.22}, {"w": "otra", "ini": 19.28, "fin": 19.46}, {"w": "sede", "ini": 19.58, "fin": 19.94}, {"w": "tomó", "ini": 20, "fin": 20.4}, {"w": "tres", "ini": 20.46, "fin": 20.68}, {"w": "días.", "ini": 20.78, "fin": 21.14}, {"w": "Es", "ini": 21.72, "fin": 21.86}, {"w": "la", "ini": 21.9, "fin": 21.96}, {"w": "estimación", "ini": 22, "fin": 22.82}, {"w": "análoga.", "ini": 22.92, "fin": 23.42}]}, {"ini": 24.3, "fin": 32.8, "texto": "O usar una fórmula: si Ramón cose dos metros por día y son ocho metros, son cuatro días. Es la estimación paramétrica.", "palabras": [{"w": "O", "ini": 24.3, "fin": 24.36}, {"w": "usar", "ini": 24.42, "fin": 24.64}, {"w": "una", "ini": 24.68, "fin": 24.82}, {"w": "fórmula:", "ini": 24.88, "fin": 25.34}, {"w": "si", "ini": 25.86, "fin": 25.96}, {"w": "Ramón", "ini": 26.02, "fin": 26.32}, {"w": "cose", "ini": 26.38, "fin": 26.66}, {"w": "dos", "ini": 26.7, "fin": 26.86}, {"w": "metros", "ini": 26.92, "fin": 27.22}, {"w": "por", "ini": 27.28, "fin": 27.4}, {"w": "día", "ini": 27.46, "fin": 27.84}, {"w": "y", "ini": 27.9, "fin": 27.96}, {"w": "son", "ini": 28.04, "fin": 28.26}, {"w": "ocho", "ini": 28.54, "fin": 28.58}, {"w": "metros,", "ini": 28.64, "fin": 28.7}, {"w": "son", "ini": 29.34, "fin": 29.6}, {"w": "cuatro", "ini": 29.68, "fin": 29.98}, {"w": "días.", "ini": 30.04, "fin": 30.36}, {"w": "Es", "ini": 31.12, "fin": 31.24}, {"w": "la", "ini": 31.28, "fin": 31.36}, {"w": "estimación", "ini": 31.4, "fin": 32.04}, {"w": "paramétrica.", "ini": 32.08, "fin": 32.8}]}, {"ini": 33.72, "fin": 44.12, "texto": "O usar tres valores: optimista, dos días; más probable, tres; pesimista, siete. Con la distribución triangular, se esperan cuatro días.", "palabras": [{"w": "O", "ini": 33.72, "fin": 33.78}, {"w": "usar", "ini": 33.84, "fin": 34.16}, {"w": "tres", "ini": 34.22, "fin": 34.38}, {"w": "valores:", "ini": 34.44, "fin": 34.86}, {"w": "optimista,", "ini": 35.14, "fin": 35.72}, {"w": "dos", "ini": 36.02, "fin": 36.2}, {"w": "días;", "ini": 36.26, "fin": 36.58}, {"w": "más", "ini": 37.04, "fin": 37.22}, {"w": "probable,", "ini": 37.26, "fin": 37.68}, {"w": "tres;", "ini": 37.86, "fin": 38.18}, {"w": "pesimista,", "ini": 38.74, "fin": 39.4}, {"w": "siete.", "ini": 39.76, "fin": 40.1}, {"w": "Con", "ini": 41.12, "fin": 41.22}, {"w": "la", "ini": 41.26, "fin": 41.32}, {"w": "distribución", "ini": 41.36, "fin": 41.98}, {"w": "triangular,", "ini": 42.02, "fin": 42.72}, {"w": "se", "ini": 42.8, "fin": 42.86}, {"w": "esperan", "ini": 42.9, "fin": 43.34}, {"w": "cuatro", "ini": 43.4, "fin": 43.72}, {"w": "días.", "ini": 43.78, "fin": 44.12}]}, {"ini": 44.7, "fin": 54.1, "texto": "O, si no se puede estimar con confianza, partir la actividad en pedazos más pequeños y sumar sus duraciones. Es la estimación ascendente.", "palabras": [{"w": "O,", "ini": 44.7, "fin": 44.84}, {"w": "si", "ini": 45.14, "fin": 45.24}, {"w": "no", "ini": 45.3, "fin": 45.4}, {"w": "se", "ini": 45.46, "fin": 45.58}, {"w": "puede", "ini": 45.62, "fin": 45.82}, {"w": "estimar", "ini": 45.86, "fin": 46.22}, {"w": "con", "ini": 46.26, "fin": 46.38}, {"w": "confianza,", "ini": 46.42, "fin": 46.94}, {"w": "partir", "ini": 47.36, "fin": 47.7}, {"w": "la", "ini": 47.74, "fin": 47.8}, {"w": "actividad", "ini": 47.86, "fin": 48.42}, {"w": "en", "ini": 48.48, "fin": 48.58}, {"w": "pedazos", "ini": 48.62, "fin": 49.08}, {"w": "más", "ini": 49.14, "fin": 49.3}, {"w": "pequeños", "ini": 49.34, "fin": 50}, {"w": "y", "ini": 50.06, "fin": 50.12}, {"w": "sumar", "ini": 50.2, "fin": 50.6}, {"w": "sus", "ini": 50.66, "fin": 50.82}, {"w": "duracio